## How to use

```bash
git clone https://git.vectorweight.com/tzervas/CogSynDelta.git
cd CogSynDelta
git checkout {{ code_revision }}
uv sync --group dev
```

{% if region == "visual" -%}
The published artifact is the EMA target encoder (`IJEPA.encode` /
`target_encoder.embed`). `wrap_deployed_visual_encoder` / `DeployedVisualEncoder`
live in `scripts/csd-benchmark.py` and wrap that same module so packed keys are
`target_encoder.*`. This block is not an executable card snippet: there is no
tiny I-JEPA checkpoint fixture in the card-snippet harness.

```python
import torch
from cogsyndelta.model.vl_jepa import IJEPA

